{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_01DFB0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"就是要射富尔顿回收的气球，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"对。可别误射吊在下面的士兵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"开枪啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"狙击步枪之类的，当然别的武器也行，总之要瞄准了再打。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"打气球吗……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"天空这么宽，要想多打些气球，也许用CO-OPS来挑战比较好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_INVENTED_SKY_PUN_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"老是做那么杀气腾腾的任务也会让人心情低落吧。偶尔来个这么悠闲的任务不是也挺好吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"而且富尔顿回收的气球看起来就像猪，好像还挺好吃的……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……先不说这个，你刚才说的“Pooyan任务”是什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我小时候，附近有户人家养猪，那头猪就叫“Pooyan”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"每次看到富尔顿回收的气球，我都会想起它。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"可我们的目标是射气球。不能对气球产生感情。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"是啊。要是气球下面吊着的是猪就好了……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……喂。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"嗯？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"没什么……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"}]}